- Follow TypeScript best practices
- Implement proper error handling

### UX Standards
- Loading states for all async operations
- Error handling with user-friendly messages
- Responsive design (mobile-first)
- Fast page load times
- Consistent animations and transitions

### Performance
- Leverage shadcn's optimized components
- Use proper loading states
- Optimize images and assets
- Implement lazy loading where appropriate

### Accessibility
- Maintain shadcn's built-in accessibility features
- Use proper ARIA labels and roles
- Ensure keyboard navigation works
- Test with screen readers

This streamlined approach ensures we leverage shadcn/ui components directly while maintaining a consistent, high-quality design system through CSS variables and Tailwind utilities.
